BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 792.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 780.00 Td (BareSnap v2.4.0 - INCREMENTAL BACKUP WITH DEDUPLICATION AND NATIVE SSH SUPPORT) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 768.00 Td (Pure C11 Engine + yad GUI \(shell\) + ncurses TUI. Static binary, zero dependencies.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 756.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 744.00 Td ("Serious backups for people who don't want to rely on anything.") Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 720.00 Td (Language:   C11 \(engine and TUI\), Shell \(yad GUI\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 708.00 Td (Binary:     Static CLI ~2 MB \(x86_64 with AES-NI\) / ~1.0 MB \(ARM64/aarch64\),) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 696.00 Td (            TUI included \(WARNING TUI IS BIT BUGGY!!\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 684.00 Td (Format:     FORMAT_VERSION=1, compatible with original C++ engine) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 672.00 Td (Crypto:     Dual-crypto: XChaCha20-Poly1305 + AES-256-GCM \(selected at init\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 660.00 Td (Hash:       Dynamic Hybrid: FNV1A \(Lightweight Legacy\) + BLAKE2B_128 \(Cryptographic\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 648.00 Td (Status:     Production. 935/935 regression tests \(FNV1A + BLAKE2B_128, meaning ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 636.00 Td (            1870 tests\) passing \(including full SSH suite, rare routes battery, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 624.00 Td (            CLI edge cases, integrated final boss, extreme resilience battery, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 612.00 Td (            chaos engineering, dual-crypto AES-256-GCM, DeLorean Effect, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 600.00 Td (            Y2K38 Apocalypse, Bit Rot, ENOSPC, Concurrent Swarm, Zombie Inode, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 588.00 Td (            Pack Tamper, Config Fuzzing, Battery Death, Entropy Firewall, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 576.00 Td (            Dynamic Snapshot Compression, Health without false positives, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 564.00 Td (            Index Grow anti-OOM, Hot CRC32C append, LRU Evacuation, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 552.00 Td (            LIST/readdir battery, integrated Valgrind modules and regression ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 540.00 Td (            of the 4 structural fixes v2.3.5: F1, O1, M1, R1\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 528.00 Td (            Valgrind: 0 leaks / 0 errors across all modules.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 516.00 Td (            ASan/UBSan: 58/58 tests, zero memory errors.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 504.00 Td (Revision:   Manual revised for v2.4.0:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 468.00 Td (Download progress in extract SSH, hardlinks and memory fixes,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 456.00 Td (SSH timeout in initial handshake, mutual exclusion in create,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 444.00 Td (new global --pass-fd flag, documented RAM defenses and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 432.00 Td (battery expanded to 935 regression tests.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 396.00 Td (- Dual-crypto: --encrypt aes activates AES-256-GCM with AES-NI.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 384.00 Td (- Delorean Effect: immune to CMOS stack reset \(1970 epoch\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 372.00 Td (- Y2K38 Apocalypse: 64-bit time_t survives beyond 2039.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 360.00 Td (- Induced Bit Rot: GCM Tag detects 1-byte mutation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 348.00 Td (- ENOSPC: atomic rollback without zombie temporaries.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 336.00 Td (- Concurrent Swarm: lock file serializes 5 processes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 324.00 Td (- Zombie Inode: hot file deletion during CDC.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 312.00 Td (- Pack Tamper: physical mutation detected by GCM/CRC.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 300.00 Td (- Config Fuzzing: corrupt config blocks verify and create.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 288.00 Td (- Battery Death: kill -9 midway through create + repair.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 276.00 Td (- Health without false positives: invalid key aborts cleanly) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 264.00 Td (  without moving healthy snapshots to damaged/ during --repair.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 240.00 Td (- anti-OOM Index Grow: re-hashing without secondary load factor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 228.00 Td (- hot append CRC32C: exact absorption of appended bytes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 216.00 Td (- LRU Evacuation: global byte counter + anti-dangling memset.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 204.00 Td (- robust LIST: snprintf validation in agent handle_list.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 192.00 Td (- Protocol V3: opcodes migrated to 0x40-0x5F \(no v2 collision\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 180.00 Td (- Frankenstein Repo: config+index deleted; create survives with controlled) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 168.00 Td (  auto-init when index metadata does not exist.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 144.00 Td (- Inconsistent Repo: config manually deleted with live index; create) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 132.00 Td (  aborts with "inconsistent state" and health --repair recovers the repo.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 108.00 Td (- health --repair: purges zombie temporaries tmp/*.tmp and recreates lost) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 96.00 Td (  or unreadable config when safe to do so.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 72.00 Td (- Entropy Firewall: microsecond abort of ZSTD/LZ4 on white noise.) Tj ET
