BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 504.00 Td (pure C cryptographic fallback \(XChaCha20\) guarantees it works on the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 492.00 Td (first try. Validated under `qemu-aarch64-static` emulation on a 2007 Core 2 Duo) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 480.00 Td (in 0.5 seconds. If it compiles and runs emulated in hell, it flies natively) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 468.00 Td (on a Raspberry Pi.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 444.00 Td (HAIKU OS \(The BeOS legacy\):) Tj ET
