BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 204.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 180.00 Td (BareSnap is an incremental backup tool with content-based) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 168.00 Td (deduplication. It was rewritten from C++ to pure C11 while maintaining) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 156.00 Td (total binary compatibility with FORMAT_VERSION=1.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 132.00 Td (Main features:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 108.00 Td (- Content-defined chunking: FastCDC \(16 KB min, 64 KB avg, 256 KB max\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 96.00 Td (- Deduplication: BLAKE2B-128 hash per chunk with global index) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 84.00 Td (- Compression: LZ4 \(default\) or ZSTD \(level 1-22\) per chunk) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 72.00 Td (- Encryption: XChaCha20-Poly1305 with Argon2 KDF \(64 MB, 3 passes\)) Tj ET
endstream
