BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 312.00 Td (============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 288.00 Td (A Bloom filter is a probabilistic structure that allows) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 276.00 Td (knowing whether a chunk can be in an index segment without) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 264.00 Td (needing to read the complete index) Tj ET
