BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 216.00 Td (    "definitely NOT present") Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 204.00 Td (    "might be present") Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 180.00 Td (It never answers:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 156.00 Td (    "definitely present") Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 132.00 Td (Therefore, upon a positive match, the real index is queried to) Tj ET
