BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 780.00 Td (- BRS_BLOOM_BITS_PER_SEG = 16 M bits = 2 MB per segment) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 768.00 Td (- BRS_BLOOM_NUM_HASHES   = 5) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 744.00 Td (With these values, the false positive rate is) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 732.00 Td (negligible even with hundreds of thousands of chunks) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 708.00 Td (Theoretical rate:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 684.00 Td (    p = \(1 - e^\(-k*n/m\)\)^k) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 660.00 Td (Example:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 636.00 Td (    k=5) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 624.00 Td (    m=16777216) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 612.00 Td (    n=1000000) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 588.00 Td (    p ≈ 1.5e-12) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 564.00 Td (Therefore, in practice, unnecessary .idx segments are not) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 552.00 Td (loaded) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 528.00 Td (============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 516.00 Td (6.3 LOADING FLOW) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 504.00 Td (============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 480.00 Td (### Local mode and SSH without full index) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 456.00 Td (1. All available .blm files are loaded:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 432.00 Td (       brs_load_bloom_set\(\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 408.00 Td (2. For each chunk to be searched:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 384.00 Td (   - The segment's Bloom filter is checked) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 372.00 Td (   - If the Bloom filter says it can NOT be present, the segment is ignored) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 360.00 Td (   - If it says it MIGHT be present, the segment's .idx is loaded:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 336.00 Td (       brs_load_index_segment\(\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 312.00 Td (   - The real index is queried:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 288.00 Td (       brs_index_map_get\(\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 264.00 Td (3. The loaded segment is kept in memory for subsequent) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 252.00 Td (   queries) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 228.00 Td (This is called lazy loading:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 204.00 Td (    The entire index is not loaded at the beginning) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 192.00 Td (    Only segments are loaded when necessary) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 168.00 Td (### SSH mode with full index) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 144.00 Td (If the entire remote index can be loaded into RAM:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 120.00 Td (    g_brs_ssh_full_index = 1) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 96.00 Td (In that case, neither Bloom filters nor lazy loading are used The complete index is used) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 84.00 Td (directly) Tj ET
endstream
