BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 96.00 Td (in RAM, turning off the compression bit if white noise is detected, optimizing) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 84.00 Td (space and saving the CPU of your old 2007 processor.) Tj ET
