BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 780.00 Td (22.4 HOW DOES THE ENGINE DETECT WHAT COMPRESSION EACH CHUNK USES?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 768.00 Td (============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 744.00 Td (The resolution is completely automatic, atomic, and bit-level. The engine) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 732.00 Td (does not rely on global metadata to decode raw bytes. Strict constants) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 720.00 Td (defined in 'brs_types.h' are evaluated directly in the hot path) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 708.00 Td (of the restore, verify, and extract commands:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 684.00 Td (- If the block has the bit active \(flags & BRS_CHUNK_FLAG_ZSTD\), the pipeline) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 672.00 Td (  invokes the libzstd decompression wrapper.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 648.00 Td (- If it has the BRS_CHUNK_FLAG_COMPRESSED bit active but not ZSTD, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 636.00 Td (  engine processes the fast stream and calls brs_lz4_decompress.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 612.00 Td (- If the entropy firewall determined the block was incompressible,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 600.00 Td (  the compression bit is turned off on disk and the engine skips that phase.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 576.00 Td (This allows logs snapshots in ZSTD-15 and code in LZ4 to coexist) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 564.00 Td (in the same physical pool without interference.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 528.00 Td (============================================================================) Tj ET
