BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 132.00 Td (  to packs/ upon clean completion. A power outage leaves an) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 120.00 Td (  orphan .tmp that the next create cleans up automatically.) Tj ET
