BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 780.00 Td (- The index uses write_file_atomic \(write-to-tmp + rename\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 768.00 Td (- The file cache may become inconsistent, but the next) Tj ET
