BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 228.00 Td (longer aborts the transfer rigidly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 204.00 Td (The system activates an Adaptive Exponential Backoff mechanism:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 192.00 Td (  1. Pauses the local pipeline by stopping consumption of the lock-free SPSC queue.) Tj ET
