BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 144.00 Td (  4. Doubles current timeout \(tmo *= 2\) and sleeps the local thread for ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 132.00 Td (      2000 ms with usleep\(\) to give oxygen to the remote hardware.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 120.00 Td (  5. Retries the read/write operation synchronously over the SSH channel.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 96.00 Td (The engine will tolerate up to 3 consecutive heartbeat stumbles and ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 84.00 Td (elastic retries before failing the operation, guaranteeing ) Tj ET
