BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 696.00 Td (\(data flowing\), poll\(\) returns before timeout.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 684.00 Td (Only aborts if socket is DEAD and unresponsive within deadline.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 660.00 Td (ELASTIC PAUSE WITH EXPONENTIAL BACKOFF \(v2.3.6\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 648.00 Td (In massive backups, continuous dump can saturate remote disk.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 636.00 Td (When poll\(\) expires on read \(pr == 0\), engine does NOT abort) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 624.00 Td (immediately. Activates backoff protocol:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 600.00 Td (1. Prints warning on stderr:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 588.00 Td (   "[WARNING] Network/Disk saturated, pausing and retrying... \(attempt X/3\)") Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 576.00 Td (2. Doubles current timeout \(tmo *= 2\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 564.00 Td (3. Sleeps local thread 2000 ms with usleep\(\) to give oxygen) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 552.00 Td (   to remote server.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 540.00 Td (4. Retries poll\(\) with new timeout.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 516.00 Td (Up to 3 consecutive retries allowed. If there is real read) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 504.00 Td (progress \(read\(\) returns > 0 bytes\), retry counter) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 492.00 Td (resets and timeout returns to base value configured by CLI.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 480.00 Td (This prevents a punctual bump from leaving timeout inflated for the) Tj ET
