BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 192.00 Td (  \(19 chars\) for compatibility with old snapshots.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 180.00 Td (- keep_by_period: period retention function restored. Necessary) Tj ET
